'''Ovis''' (オビス) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[LINE Pokopang! Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 7.0 Update|Version 7.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Ovis
|image = E 400.png
|appearance = [[LINE Pokopang! Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 750¢ - 2,962¢
}}

==Enemy==
With 200,000 health at base strength magnification, Ovis is the tanker of the Pokopang group, and at his strongest ([[Rainbow Blast!]] at 3 crown difficulty), he'll have 400,000 health. Additionally, he only has one knockback.

==Strategy==
There is not much one can do to Ovis besides deplete his enormous health pool with many attackers. [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Hip Hop Cat]]'s range is on par with Ovis' and can always take at least the very first hit from him if his True Form has been unlocked. [[Fencer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fencer Cat]] would be complementary to Hip Hop because he can outrange Ovis and still do some good damage. But if Ovis is with other Pokopang members, such as Pokota and/or Coco, Crazed Bahamut Cat should also be present to keep them at bay.

